    "note": "Great Mothers lead is the MODERN clear and the one Astra can field: all five of these are R7+, while the classic Old Daka / Mother Talzin / Nightsister Zombie lineup is stranded at R5 and below the phase-3 floor. MECHANIC: Merrin gains 100% TM the first time a Nightsister ally is defeated and +15% (+2%/relic) on every later death or revive, so letting Nightsisters die and come back IS the engine \u2014 do not play to keep them alive. Wave 1 hits hardest: spread Tenacity Down first (Zombie's basic if he is in), then stack Plague; Talzin is much stronger once Tenacity Down is out. A revive also grants all allies Instant Defeat Immunity 2 turns. starwars-fans.com 2024/10 + Xaereth youtube KfcoTSb7oQ4."
